For every flower card in main.html, create a separate HTML page.

Example:

flower1.html
flower2.html
flower3.html

Create as many pages as the number of flower cards you have.

Add a Navbar
Each flower page should have a navbar at the top (same style as your main page).
Add a Bigger Flower Image
On the flower page, show a bigger image of the flower

Your page should contain:

🌸 Flower Name (use <h1> or <h2>)
🖼 Flower Image
📝 Paragraph with:
Flower type
Flower price

Hint 💡

You can copy the structure from project1.html that we created together.
Then change:
the header
the image
the paragraph text
so that it matches your Flower Shop website.
